{"about_the_game":"<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE GAME</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a cyborg whose objective is to rebuild \u201cTHE LIGHTHOUSE\u201d in order to construct the \u201cDIMENSIONAL ENGINE.\u201d But to achieve this, you will have to travel through multiple Dimensions using \u201cDIMENSIONAL PORTALS\u201d to gather and craft the necessary materials.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704010/extras/6f0a56aa1203c7d7a28b63634572991a.avif?t=1773938937\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704010/extras_big/6f0a56aa1203c7d7a28b63634572991a.avif?t=1773938937 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DIMENSIONS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through multiple Dimensions and their completely unique biomes via the &quot;DIMENSIONAL PORTAL&quot;. Exists 4 different Dimensions: Initial Dimension, Radioactive Dimension, Interdimensional Void and Hellish Dimension.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704010/extras/444f3ccf77326495c1db35e782b2437c.avif?t=1773938937\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704010/extras_big/444f3ccf77326495c1db35e782b2437c.avif?t=1773938937 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NATURAL RESOURCES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Natural Resources are a very important pillar of the game, because they allow you to obtain the Basic Resources. They divided into 4 types: &quot;Nature Resources&quot;, &quot;Mine Resources&quot; &quot;Floor Resources&quot; and &quot;Resource Wells (Fluids)&quot;.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704010/extras/6fd976346d049647e4764a0cb9f97d84.avif?t=1773938937\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704010/extras_big/6fd976346d049647e4764a0cb9f97d84.avif?t=1773938937 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704010/extras/62efe231ab8769756a6b0fc4da5d6064.avif?t=1773938937\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704010/extras_big/62efe231ab8769756a6b0fc4da5d6064.avif?t=1773938937 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>STRUCTURES: </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Structures and Buildings are objects that help the player perform a wide variety of tasks such as: Crafting or Storing Items, Generating Resources or Energy, Boosts the Player or other Structure, etc.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704010/extras/6eadd10374f4c233a932589c7d01fc0b.avif?t=1773938937\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704010/extras_big/6eadd10374f4c233a932589c7d01fc0b.webp?t=1773938937 width=1560 height=694 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704010/extras/fcffbc58542779baf9175013dff7fa51.avif?t=1773938937